{{Codex|Prisma-crystal enhancement creates here a prestige instrument; a weapon capable of taking life at astonishing range with but a single pull of its exquisitely-tooled trigger.}}
The '''Prisma Grinlok''' is the [[Prisma]] variant of the {{Weapon|Grinlok}} semi-automatic rifle featuring higher [[critical chance]], [[critical multiplier]], [[status chance]], magazine, and different damage distribution, but lower [[accuracy]] with sustained fire.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Slash}} damage.
*Can equip the Grinlok-exclusive {{M|Deadly Sequence}} and {{M|Grinloked}} ([[Conclave]] only) mods.
*Innate {{Pol|Madurai}} polarity.

{{Advantages|class=Rifle|trigger=Semi-Auto|
*Tied with {{Weapon|Grinlok}} for the second highest base damage of all semi-automatic rifles, behind {{Weapon|Kuva Chakkhurr}}.
*Second highest [[critical multiplier]] of all semi-automatic rifles, behind {{Weapon|Tiberon Prime}}.
*Second highest [[status chance]] of all semi-automatic rifles, behind {{Weapon|Nagantaka}}.
*Little to no vertical [[recoil]].
*Very small spread.
*Excellent ammo efficiency.
}}

{{Disadvantages|class=Rifle|trigger=Semi-Auto|
*Tied with {{Weapon|Grinlok}} for the second slowest [[fire rate]] of all semi-automatic rifles, after {{Weapon|Kuva Chakkhurr}}.
}}

{{WeaponComparison|Grinlok}}

==Acquisition==
The Prisma Grinlok is potentially sold by [[Baro Ki'Teer]] in the Concourse section of the [[Tenno]] [[Relay]] for {{cc|220,000}} and ‍{{dc|500}}. Note that Baro Ki'Teer's stock changes with each appearance, and this weapon may not be available on a succeeding appearance.

The weapon can be [[Trade_System|traded]], but only for unranked copies without [[Forma]] and [[Orokin Catalyst]] installed. The trading recipient must also have a [[Mastery Rank]] of at least 11.

