{{Codex|The explosive power of the Lenz, enhanced with Prisma crystals.}}

The '''Prisma Lenz''' is the special [[Prisma]] version of the {{Weapon|Lenz}} explosive bow, featuring increased damage, [[Critical Multiplier]], [[Status Chance]], and [[Ammo Maximum]], and faster [[Fire Rate|Charge Time]].

==Characteristics==
*This weapon deals primarily {{D|Blast}} damage.
*Arrow explodes on impacting a surface or enemy.
**Direct arrow impact has a guaranteed {{D|Impact}} proc and stagger enemies.
**Initial explosion has a guaranteed {{D|Cold}} proc in a '''7.2''' meter radius when impacting enemies or surfaces.
**'''1.3''' seconds after the {{D|Cold}} effect, another explosion occurs in a '''7.2''' meter radius, dealing very high {{D|Blast}} damage.
**Initial hit and explosions apply [[status]] separately.
**Explosions require [[Line of Sight]] to deal damage.
***[[Line of Sight]] is affected by [[Punch Through]]; Sufficient amounts of Punch Through allows the explosion to deal damage to enemies not within line of sight.
**{{D|Blast}} explosion does not occur if the arrow hits allies.
*{{M|Heavy Caliber}}'s accuracy penalty is minimal on this weapon.
*On kill, bodies will follow the arrow that killed them, damaging anyone in their path and pinning the corpse to walls.
*Innate {{M|Arrow Mutation}} effect.
*Can benefit from {{M|Firestorm}} ({{M|Primed Firestorm|Primed}}) and {{M|Cautious Shot}}.
*[[Fire rate]] mods apply double their bonuses.

{{Advantages|class=Bow|}}
{{Disadvantages|class=Bow|}}

